# Local IPOs: every value the market uses is an option. The Options page, built as the game
# builds it, has a slider for each: the player's four groups while Local IPOs is on, and the finer
# workings in dev builds. Each label says its value. Reads only; nothing is changed.
name local ipos: Options has a slider for every Local IPOs value, each label saying its value
local-ipos on
options-preview on
expect-ipo-options 37
capture ipo-options
cleanup:
options-preview off
local-ipos restore
